{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "bc135b44-c1e3-4833-a4e3-5331dd1733a5",
    "name": "pipeline-showcase",
    "description": "Orders ingest demo — PUTs JSON/NDJSON files into the Databricks Volume that Auto Loader watches (`{{ORDERS_PATH}}`). Covers new-order, exact-duplicate (no-op), changed-duplicate (new SCD2 version), validation-rejection, and batch scenarios. Requires the companion environment (copy `pipeline-showcase.postman_environment.example.json`, fill in `DATABRICKS_HOST` / `DATABRICKS_TOKEN`, never commit the filled-in copy).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      { "key": "token", "value": "{{DATABRICKS_TOKEN}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "filename", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Ingest — Single Order",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "New order",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('filename', 'single-new-' + pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$timestamp}}') + '-' + pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}') + '.json');",
                  "pm.variables.set('nowIso', new Date().toISOString().replace(/\\.\\d+Z$/, 'Z'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"order_id\":\"ORD-90001\",\"customer_id\":\"CUST-2001\",\"item_name\":\"Trail Runner Backpack\",\"quantity\":1,\"unit_price\":89.99,\"order_date\":\"{{nowIso}}\",\"created_time\":\"{{nowIso}}\"}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{DATABRICKS_HOST}}/api/2.0/fs/files{{ORDERS_PATH}}/{{filename}}?overwrite=false"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Exact duplicate (expect no-op)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('filename', 'single-dup-exact-' + pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$timestamp}}') + '-' + pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}') + '.json');",
                  "pm.variables.set('nowIso', new Date().toISOString().replace(/\\.\\d+Z$/, 'Z'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"order_id\":\"ORD-10001\",\"customer_id\":\"CUST-1001\",\"item_name\":\"Widget A\",\"quantity\":2,\"unit_price\":12.50,\"order_date\":\"<<PASTE order_date FROM scripts/seed_files/seed-ORD-10001.json HERE>>\",\"created_time\":\"{{nowIso}}\"}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{DATABRICKS_HOST}}/api/2.0/fs/files{{ORDERS_PATH}}/{{filename}}?overwrite=false",
            "description": "Before running this request, open scripts/seed_files/seed-ORD-10001.json (regenerate it first via `python scripts/generate_seed_data.py` if needed) and paste its exact `order_date` value here, replacing the placeholder. This must byte-match the already-ingested seed row for the no-op/changed-duplicate scenarios to work correctly."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Changed duplicate (expect new SCD2 version)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('filename', 'single-dup-changed-' + pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$timestamp}}') + '-' + pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}') + '.json');",
                  "// Same ORD-10001 identity/order_date as the exact-duplicate request, but quantity changed 2 -> 5 to force a new SCD2 version.",
                  "pm.variables.set('nowIso', new Date().toISOString().replace(/\\.\\d+Z$/, 'Z'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"order_id\":\"ORD-10001\",\"customer_id\":\"CUST-1001\",\"item_name\":\"Widget A\",\"quantity\":5,\"unit_price\":12.50,\"order_date\":\"<<PASTE order_date FROM scripts/seed_files/seed-ORD-10001.json HERE>>\",\"created_time\":\"{{nowIso}}\"}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{DATABRICKS_HOST}}/api/2.0/fs/files{{ORDERS_PATH}}/{{filename}}?overwrite=false",
            "description": "Before running this request, open scripts/seed_files/seed-ORD-10001.json (regenerate it first via `python scripts/generate_seed_data.py` if needed) and paste its exact `order_date` value here, replacing the placeholder. This must byte-match the already-ingested seed row for the no-op/changed-duplicate scenarios to work correctly."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Invalid: amount",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('filename', 'single-invalid-amount-' + pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$timestamp}}') + '-' + pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}') + '.json');",
                  "pm.variables.set('nowIso', new Date().toISOString().replace(/\\.\\d+Z$/, 'Z'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"order_id\":\"ORD-90004\",\"customer_id\":\"CUST-2001\",\"item_name\":\"Trail Runner Backpack\",\"quantity\":1,\"unit_price\":-10.00,\"order_date\":\"{{nowIso}}\",\"created_time\":\"{{nowIso}}\"}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{DATABRICKS_HOST}}/api/2.0/fs/files{{ORDERS_PATH}}/{{filename}}?overwrite=false"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Invalid: quantity",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('filename', 'single-invalid-quantity-' + pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$timestamp}}') + '-' + pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}') + '.json');",
                  "pm.variables.set('nowIso', new Date().toISOString().replace(/\\.\\d+Z$/, 'Z'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"order_id\":\"ORD-90005\",\"customer_id\":\"CUST-2001\",\"item_name\":\"Trail Runner Backpack\",\"quantity\":0,\"unit_price\":89.99,\"order_date\":\"{{nowIso}}\",\"created_time\":\"{{nowIso}}\"}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{DATABRICKS_HOST}}/api/2.0/fs/files{{ORDERS_PATH}}/{{filename}}?overwrite=false"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Invalid: future date",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('filename', 'single-invalid-futuredate-' + pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$timestamp}}') + '-' + pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}') + '.json');",
                  "const f = new Date(); f.setFullYear(f.getFullYear()+1); pm.variables.set('futureOrderDate', f.toISOString().replace(/\\.\\d+Z$/, 'Z'));",
                  "pm.variables.set('nowIso', new Date().toISOString().replace(/\\.\\d+Z$/, 'Z'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"order_id\":\"ORD-90006\",\"customer_id\":\"CUST-2001\",\"item_name\":\"Trail Runner Backpack\",\"quantity\":1,\"unit_price\":89.99,\"order_date\":\"{{futureOrderDate}}\",\"created_time\":\"{{nowIso}}\"}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{DATABRICKS_HOST}}/api/2.0/fs/files{{ORDERS_PATH}}/{{filename}}?overwrite=false"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Invalid: null required field",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('filename', 'single-invalid-nullfield-' + pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$timestamp}}') + '-' + pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}') + '.json');",
                  "pm.variables.set('nowIso', new Date().toISOString().replace(/\\.\\d+Z$/, 'Z'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"order_id\":\"ORD-90007\",\"customer_id\":null,\"item_name\":\"Trail Runner Backpack\",\"quantity\":1,\"unit_price\":89.99,\"order_date\":\"{{nowIso}}\",\"created_time\":\"{{nowIso}}\"}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{DATABRICKS_HOST}}/api/2.0/fs/files{{ORDERS_PATH}}/{{filename}}?overwrite=false"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Ingest — Batch Orders",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Batch — new orders",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('filename', 'batch-new-' + pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$timestamp}}') + '-' + pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}') + '.json');",
                  "pm.variables.set('nowIso', new Date().toISOString().replace(/\\.\\d+Z$/, 'Z'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-ndjson" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"order_id\":\"ORD-90010\",\"customer_id\":\"CUST-3001\",\"item_name\":\"Widget A\",\"quantity\":4,\"unit_price\":12.50,\"order_date\":\"{{nowIso}}\",\"created_time\":\"{{nowIso}}\"}\n{\"order_id\":\"ORD-90011\",\"customer_id\":\"CUST-3002\",\"item_name\":\"Camp Stove\",\"quantity\":2,\"unit_price\":54.00,\"order_date\":\"{{nowIso}}\",\"created_time\":\"{{nowIso}}\"}\n{\"order_id\":\"ORD-90012\",\"customer_id\":\"CUST-3003\",\"item_name\":\"Trail Runner Backpack\",\"quantity\":1,\"unit_price\":89.99,\"order_date\":\"{{nowIso}}\",\"created_time\":\"{{nowIso}}\"}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "text" } }
            },
            "url": "{{DATABRICKS_HOST}}/api/2.0/fs/files{{ORDERS_PATH}}/{{filename}}?overwrite=false"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Batch — mixed (new + changed-duplicate)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('filename', 'batch-mixed-' + pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$timestamp}}') + '-' + pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}') + '.json');",
                  "// Third line reuses ORD-10001 with a changed quantity to prove the batch/NDJSON path hits the same SCD2 logic as the single-object path.",
                  "pm.variables.set('nowIso', new Date().toISOString().replace(/\\.\\d+Z$/, 'Z'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-ndjson" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"order_id\":\"ORD-90013\",\"customer_id\":\"CUST-3004\",\"item_name\":\"Widget A\",\"quantity\":3,\"unit_price\":12.50,\"order_date\":\"{{nowIso}}\",\"created_time\":\"{{nowIso}}\"}\n{\"order_id\":\"ORD-90014\",\"customer_id\":\"CUST-3005\",\"item_name\":\"Camp Stove\",\"quantity\":1,\"unit_price\":54.00,\"order_date\":\"{{nowIso}}\",\"created_time\":\"{{nowIso}}\"}\n{\"order_id\":\"ORD-10001\",\"customer_id\":\"CUST-1001\",\"item_name\":\"Widget A\",\"quantity\":7,\"unit_price\":12.50,\"order_date\":\"<<PASTE order_date FROM scripts/seed_files/seed-ORD-10001.json HERE>>\",\"created_time\":\"{{nowIso}}\"}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "text" } }
            },
            "url": "{{DATABRICKS_HOST}}/api/2.0/fs/files{{ORDERS_PATH}}/{{filename}}?overwrite=false",
            "description": "Before running this request, open scripts/seed_files/seed-ORD-10001.json (regenerate it first via `python scripts/generate_seed_data.py` if needed) and paste its exact `order_date` value here, replacing the placeholder (third NDJSON line, ORD-10001). This must byte-match the already-ingested seed row for the no-op/changed-duplicate scenarios to work correctly."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
